---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Image from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';
import newtonImage1 from '../../../assets/badge icons/newton_1.png';
import newtonImage2 from '../../../assets/badge icons/newton_2.png';
import newtonImage3 from '../../../assets/newton_3.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Newton's Karate: From Classmates to Legends | Shelby Web Company"
  description="Community Spotlight on Newton's Karate — building confidence, discipline, and character across Cleveland County since 1996."
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <header class="mb-16 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-500/5">
          <span class="text-orange-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Community Spotlight</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-orange-500/30"></span>
          <span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          From Crest High Classmates to Local Business Owners: <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue">Celebrating Jimmy Newton and Newton's Karate</span>
        </h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          If you've lived around Shelby for very long, chances are you've heard the name Newton's Karate.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          For me, though, the story is a little more personal.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Jimmy Newton and I graduated together from Crest High School's Class of 1996. Like many classmates, life eventually took us down different career paths. I went into web development and digital marketing with Shelby Web Company, while Jimmy dedicated himself to something that has positively impacted hundreds of families throughout Cleveland County: teaching traditional karate.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Today, Newton's Karate has become one of Shelby's most respected martial arts schools, helping children and adults develop confidence, discipline, respect, and practical self-defense skills every single day.
        </p>

        <div class="my-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-[380px] mx-auto">
          <Image src={newtonImage3} alt="Newton's Karate new facility in Shelby" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Continuing a Local Legacy</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Many longtime Shelby residents remember Sensei Willie McIntosh and the tremendous influence he had on martial arts in our community.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Jimmy began training under Sensei McIntosh in 1994 and eventually carried that legacy forward by opening Newton's Karate in 2006. Rather than simply teaching martial arts, Jimmy has remained committed to preserving the traditions of authentic Okinawan Shorin-Ryu Karate while creating an environment where students can grow both physically and mentally.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          That commitment to tradition and excellence is one of the reasons Newton's Karate has become such a respected name throughout the region.
        </p>

        <div class="my-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-[150px] mx-auto">
          <Image src={newtonImage1} alt="Jimmy Newton at Newton's Karate" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">More Than Learning to Punch and Kick</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          One thing that stands out about Newton's Karate is that the lessons go far beyond martial arts techniques.
        </p>

        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 list-none p-0 mb-12">
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Self-confidence</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Respect for others</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Self-discipline</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Goal setting</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Patience</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Leadership</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Physical fitness</span></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="my-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-[150px] mx-auto">
          <Image src={newtonImage2} alt="Students training at Newton's Karate" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          These life skills often become just as valuable outside the dojo as they are during class.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Parents throughout Cleveland County consistently look for activities that build character, and karate continues to be one of the best investments they can make in their children's future.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Excellence That Speaks for Itself</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Jimmy has dedicated decades to mastering his craft.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Today he serves as Head Instructor at Newton's Karate and has earned advanced black belt rankings in both Shorin-Ryu Karate and Kobudo. Under his leadership, the school has produced numerous state, regional, and national competitors while also earning recognition as one of the AAU's Top 20 karate clubs in the country.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          While awards are certainly impressive, it's the impact on students and families that matters most.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Every class represents another opportunity to help someone become more confident, more disciplined, and more prepared for life's challenges.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">A New Chapter for Newton's Karate</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          After years of serving the community, Newton's Karate recently moved into a beautiful new facility on South DeKalb Street in Shelby. The expanded space allows Jimmy and his instructors to continue growing while providing an even better experience for current and future students. It represents another exciting milestone for a business that has steadily served Cleveland County for nearly two decades.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Supporting Local Businesses Matters</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          One of the things I enjoy most through Shelby Web Company is seeing local businesses succeed.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Building a successful business is not easy. It takes years of consistency, dedication, and earning the trust of your community.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Jimmy has done exactly that.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you're looking for karate classes for your child, wanting to improve your own fitness, or simply searching for an environment that teaches discipline and respect, Newton's Karate has built a reputation that's well deserved.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          As a fellow Crest High School Class of 1996 graduate, it's been great watching Jimmy build something that continues making a positive difference in Shelby.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-600 to-brand-darkest p-10 rounded-[2rem] text-center relative overflow-hidden my-12">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,rgba(255,165,0,0.1),transparent_70%)]"></div>
          <p class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium relative z-10">
            Congratulations on everything you've accomplished, Jimmy. Here's to many more years of serving our community.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Interested in learning more about Newton's Karate?
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Visit their website to explore programs for children and adults, class schedules, and upcoming events:
        </p>

        <p class="mb-12">
          <a href="https://newtons-karate.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline decoration-brand-cyan/30 underline-offset-4">https://newtons-karate.com/</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">More Community Spotlights</h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-brand-sky/70">
          <p>Read more about the people and businesses keeping our region strong: <a href="/blog/daniel-thomas-mayor-boiling-springs-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Mayor Daniel Thomas of Boiling Springs</a>, <a href="/blog/class-of-96-gabe-whisnant-shelby-star/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Gabe Whisnant of The Shelby Star &amp; Newsweek</a>, and <a href="/blog/fs-expedited-llc-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">F&amp;S Expedited LLC</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">Love seeing local businesses thrive? We spotlight Cleveland County companies through our <a href="/services/web-design/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">web design</a> and <a href="/services/seo/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">local SEO</a> services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-8 items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/blog/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Blog
        </a>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <a href="/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
          <a href="/about/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">About Us</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
